Hello, players!

We're sorry that due to the size of our team (4 people), this may lead to insufficient internal testing before our updates. As a result, we need to check for bugs and fix them all the time based on the feedback from our players.

So if you have come across any bugs or issues, please let us know by posting them on this topic:
[b][url=https://steamcommunity.com/app/747200/discussions/0/3388408347644295235/]https://steamcommunity.com/app/747200/discussions/0/3388408347644295235/[/url][/b]

Also, any feedback and suggestions will be much appreciated! We will fix the issues and update you as soon as we can. Thank you!

TARO



