[h1]Version 1.0.4 (June 8, 2022) :[/h1]
[olist]
[*] - We separated the character data under each steam account. After version 1.0.4, the newly created character and map archives will be saved in a separate folder corresponding to the steam account. Before version 1.0.4 The updated save file will be automatically copied into a separate folder when entering the game for the first time, which solves the problem that the game save file is synchronously cleared by the steam cloud when switching accounts. (Note: When opening the 1.0.4 version of the game for the first time, please use the account that logged in to Steam for the last time, otherwise the old archive will still be cleared by the steam cloud synchronization. You can also temporarily disable the cloud archive when you open the 1.0.4 version for the first time);
[*] - Fixed a bug where the host player's follower's ranged weapon attack speed was too slow in multiplayer mode;
[*] - Fixed a bug that the attack speed of weapons and tools with high attack speed slowed down when the game frame rate was reduced;
[*] - Fixed the bug that the blood volume of the pet-boss rabbit was low;
[*] - Fixed a bug where the player might get stuck in the wall and cannot move after being resurrected from death or teleporting back to the spawn point with a rift stone.
[/olist]

[h1]Version 1.0.3 (June 2, 2022) :[/h1]
[olist]
[*] - Fixed a bug that when the player left a newly born replica alone in Schip's lab, there was a high probability that this replica would disappear directly;
[*] - Fixed a bug that caused pets or followers to be lost when players left them alone in Schip's lab;
[*] - Fixed a bug where an area in the gene panel can not be clicked in the Replica Incubator interface.
[/olist]

[h1]Version 1.0.2 (June 1, 2022) :[/h1]
[olist]
[*] - At present, we found that when the player brings pets, mounts and followers then saves and back to main menu（or exit）could cause player's mounts, pets and followers to disappear, [b]now we have fixed it[/b]. We are still looking for other bugs with the same consequences, please give us some time.
[/olist]

[h1]Version 1.0.1 (June 1, 2022) :[/h1]
[olist]
[*] - Corrected the English grammar mistakes and spelling mistakes in the game (thanks to the enthusiastic players for their corrections);
[*] - Fixed a bug that occurred when the player cut the Goat king's wool (The goat king whose model has been wrong will return to normal after a while);
[*] - Fixed a bug where the player standing near the chests and click the "Quick stack to nearby chest" button in the backpack, but the surrounding chests are full may cause items to disappear and not in the chests;
[*] - Now, the boos Divil has a new phantom skill and she will no longer be invisible when she casts this skill;
[*] - Permanently removed the stun effect of Divil's red energy field cast after being defeated by players.
[/olist]

